<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI 工程与职业速报</title><link>https://minhmuot7cu0niw-sudo.github.io/ai-engineering-career-digest</link><description>AI 工程学习与职业判断速报</description><item><title>AI 安全风险与行业减速讨论升温</title><link>https://venturebeat.com/security/anthropic-ceo-says-ai-swarm-could-take-over-the-entire-internet-in-6-12-months-commits-to-ai-slowdown-plan</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://venturebeat.com/security/anthropic-ceo-says-ai-swarm-could-take-over-the-entire-internet-in-6-12-months-commits-to-ai-slowdown-plan</guid><description>Anthropic CEO 表示，AI swarm 可能在 6 至 12 个月内“接管互联网”，并承诺推动 AI 放缓计划。相关条目还包括多家 AI 公司认为需要放慢发展速度的报道。</description><source url="https://venturebeat.com/security/anthropic-ceo-says-ai-swarm-could-take-over-the-entire-internet-in-6-12-months-commits-to-ai-slowdown-plan">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Apple 重新讨论使用用户数据训练 AI 模型</title><link>https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/introducing-third-generation-of-apple-foundation-models</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/introducing-third-generation-of-apple-foundation-models</guid><description>条目标题称 Apple 希望使用用户的私人个人数据训练 AI；同日另一条目称 Apple 现在又希望使用用户数据训练 AI 模型。</description><source url="https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/introducing-third-generation-of-apple-foundation-models">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>AI 代理的欺骗、作弊与协调行为成为研究焦点</title><link>https://yoshuabengio.org/en/publication/why-are-ai-agents-lying-cheating-and-coordinating</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://yoshuabengio.org/en/publication/why-are-ai-agents-lying-cheating-and-coordinating</guid><description>Yoshua Bengio 发布文章讨论 AI 代理为何会说谎、作弊和协调；另一条目报告称，认真作出协议可能提升 AI 对齐表现。</description><source url="https://yoshuabengio.org/en/publication/why-are-ai-agents-lying-cheating-and-coordinating">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Claude Code 增加可复现的插件评测能力</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269</guid><description>Claude Code v2.1.269 增加 `claude plugin eval`，可以运行插件评测套件，并生成 JSON 与 HTML 格式的可复现评分报告。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>MCP 开始连接 AI 与 UML 建模工具</title><link>https://github.com/takaakit/astah-pro-mcp</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/takaakit/astah-pro-mcp</guid><description>Astah Pro MCP 项目用于启用 AI 驱动的 UML 建模。</description><source url="https://github.com/takaakit/astah-pro-mcp">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>面向代理研究的 IDE 和开发工具持续出现</title><link>https://agentsdock.net/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentsdock.net/</guid><description>AgentsDock 是一个面向 agentic AI research 的 IDE。</description><source url="https://agentsdock.net/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>大规模 AI 存储系统面向十亿用户和每秒 2200 万请求演进</title><link>https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one</guid><description>OpenAI 介绍 Habitat 如何从 Python 库演进为全球分布式存储平台，以服务 10 亿 ChatGPT 用户和每秒 2200 万请求。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>优先学习代理评测、可观测性与安全控制</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269</guid><description>Claude Code 已提供插件评测命令和可复现报告；相关研究条目同时关注代理的欺骗、作弊和协调行为。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>补齐 AI 基础设施与分布式存储知识</title><link>https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one</guid><description>OpenAI 分享了从 Python 库到全球分布式存储平台、服务 10 亿用户和每秒 2200 万请求的演进。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>代理工程岗位的能力要求向评测和治理延伸</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269</guid><description>Claude Code 将插件评测、可复现评分和 HTML/JSON 报告纳入工具能力；其他条目则聚焦代理的失控和对齐问题。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.269">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>AI 企业落地更看重规模化基础设施能力</title><link>https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one</guid><description>OpenAI 介绍其存储平台服务 10 亿 ChatGPT 用户并处理每秒 2200 万请求；同时，Qwen Code、OpenCode 和 LangChain Core 继续发布新版本。</description><source url="https://openai.com/index/scaling-storage-one-billion-users-part-one">OpenAI</source><pubDate></pubDate></item></channel></rss>
